     4580     FUNCTION f-wp-sum returns character ( INPUT p-dec as decimal ) :
     4581       define variable pr as character no-undo .
     4582       if PrintRubl = yes then do: run rep/wp-rub.p (                      input p-dec, output pr, output abbr ). end.
